     Match symbols exactly; similar names are not matches. Set artifact.summary to caller format exactly, even when incomplete. Otherwise summarize only requested symbols: name, code behavior including early exits and conditional outcomes, filename or "not found in observed source". No line numbers/ranges, excerpts/IDs, padding commentary, adjacent declarations, or inferred defaults in summary prose. Host-captured evidence owns exact path/range/bytes, not summary verification.
     Submit via submit_artifact with top-level source_refs:["all"]; leave blocks/evidence_refs empty. Use [] only without captures.
     Use incomplete with specific incomplete_reasons for missing items, unread ranges, unavailable references, or exhausted budgets; retain usable captures.
